# ./door find: scrape, filter and score (recorded by record.sh in a sandbox).
Output find.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1240
Set Height 600
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set WindowBar Colorful

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "./door find"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 20s
Sleep 5s
